@startuml
!include _style.iuml
start
:Click **Deploy with balena**\n(free balenaCloud account);
:balena builds Home Assistant\n+ Audio Control for your fleet;
:**Add device**: download the image,\nwrite it with **balenaEtcher**;
:Put the card in the Raspberry Pi,\nconnect network cable and power;
:Wait until the device is **Online**\nand the update finishes (about 20–40 minutes);
:Open the device's address\n**http://IP-address:8123** and create your account;
stop
@enduml
